29
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,959
It depends on your performance.

30
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,040
But I'm hungry now.

31
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:20,040
I want to eat.

32
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:22,840
You woman,

33
