39
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:47,039
Li.

40
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:48,639
Come on, please go inside.

41
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:49,199
Go inside.

42
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:49,680
Upstairs, please.

43
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,280
This way.

44
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,159
Have a seat.

45
00:02:53,159 --> 00:02:53,879
Everyone,

46
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:55,639
