104
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,600
I shouldn't have got into trouble.

105
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,959
But I can't help it if someone wants to die.

106
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:53,199
You're so arrogant.

107
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:53,879
What?

108
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,279
