109
00:04:56,079 --> 00:04:58,319
Come on, come on, beat me.

110
00:04:58,519 --> 00:04:59,600
Come on, beat me.

111
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:02,480
Young master.

112
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:04,519
Master Liu.

113
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,319
