135
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,160
But you,

136
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,839
barehanded.

137
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:40,839
No matter how good you are at fighting,

138
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,120
you can't

139
