152
00:07:28,079 --> 00:07:28,839
Eat if you like.

153
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:30,480
If not, forget it.

154
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,600
Why are you looking at me?

155
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,040
I just think

156
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,240
