158
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,519
I can't help but look at you.

159
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,079
By the way,

160
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:48,639
in your story,

161
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:50,800
