179
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:32,080
Forget it.

180
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,080
I'm not interested in women.

181
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:37,120
I just want the throne.

182
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:41,559
But,

183
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:43,960
if you keep painting,

184
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:45,799
