205
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,039
I wasn't sleeping.

206
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:30,440
I wasn't sleeping.

207
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:32,399
I was just thinking.

208
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:33,279
Don't dock my pay.

209
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:36,919
What were you thinking about?

210
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,639
I...

211
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:42,159
These past few days,

212
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,840
I've felt your difficulties firsthand.

213
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,360
I can truly empathize now.

214
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:47,720
How so?

215
