242
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:49,840
I'm a bit tired today.

243
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:52,720
You should go back and rest early.

244
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:55,159
Okay, off work.

245
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,159
Remember what I said.

246
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,159
