254
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:23,720
Thank the Prince for me.

255
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,960
Young people are so pure.

256
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:43,039
Shen Li.

257
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:46,159
My new work, The Prince's Promotion,

258
00:12:46,399 --> 00:12:47,600
