259
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:48,960
You are the Crown Prince's guard.

260
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,639
You are the most qualified to be the chief reader.

261
00:12:51,159 --> 00:12:52,120
Help me.

262
00:12:55,639 --> 00:12:56,120
This...

263
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:57,879
