280
00:13:31,279 --> 00:13:32,039
Oumo,

281
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:34,639
this plot...

282
00:13:51,159 --> 00:13:52,080
It's been a while

283
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,519
