285
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,480
Since you summoned me,

286
00:13:56,159 --> 00:13:57,240
I had to come.

287
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,080
So,

288
00:13:58,879 --> 00:13:59,679
