290
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:04,720
I haven't forgotten what you did.

291
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,960
It's been a while.

292
00:14:07,519 --> 00:14:09,960
How have you been?

293
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:12,960
Thanks to you,

294
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,240
