298
00:14:21,159 --> 00:14:21,679
So,

299
00:14:22,159 --> 00:14:23,559
the one inside you

300
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,279
has awakened.

301
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:28,159
Your Grace is truly well-informed.

302
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:30,799
If I didn't have this ability,

303
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,320
how could I survive in this palace?

304
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,559
But don't worry,

305
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,039
I've kept your secret

306
00:14:37,039 --> 00:14:38,759
for so many years.

307
00:14:38,879 --> 00:14:40,480
It won't be exposed in a short time.

308
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,399
As long as you behave yourself,

309
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,679
when the Emperor dies,

310
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,480
I will help you

311
00:14:47,039 --> 00:14:48,559
secure the throne.

312
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,519
What's the price?

313
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:56,720
[It should be here.]

314
00:14:57,799 --> 00:14:59,360
[What kind of woman]

315
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,559
[does Gu Jiachen like?]

316
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:06,120
[I'm just looking for inspiration for painting.]

317
00:15:06,679 --> 00:15:07,879
[I don't care about anything else.]

318
00:15:18,559 --> 00:15:20,159
I've never asked for much.

319
00:15:20,639 --> 00:15:21,879
You keep your position,

320
00:15:22,159 --> 00:15:24,000
and I keep my power.

321
00:15:24,279 --> 00:15:25,639
We both get what we want.

322
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,080
Isn't that good?

323
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:31,759
If you're obedient, I'll spoil you.

324
00:15:32,519 --> 00:15:33,759
If you're not,

325
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:36,240
I can keep your secret,

326
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:39,519
or I can make it known to all.

327
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:43,679
You know what happened

328
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:45,679
to the Crown Prince when he was deposed.

329
00:15:50,399 --> 00:15:50,919
Who's there?
